        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Hamilton CH-105-BP Large Double Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis large double pronged hook made by Hamilton from solid bronze with a bronze patina finish. Most often mounted near front doors, in closets, or in bathrooms for towels, it comes packaged with 2 oval head wood screws. It is built to last and comes with a lifetime warranty. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/hami-ch-105-size.jpg?v=1704354604\" width=\"233\" height=\"177\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Hamilton CH-105 Hook Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Hamilton CH-105 Utility Hook: \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Package includes 3 slotted oval head wood screws.</li>\r\n<li>Hooks have a bronze patina finish and are made out of solid bronze.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Hamilton Large Double Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Bronze Patina</b></li>\r\n<li>Top Prong Projection: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Prong Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly 1 Left.\r\n</b>\r\n</p>",
